  "contract_id": "dsv4_compression_metadata@1.0",
  "description": "sglang's DeepSeek-V4 compressed-cache metadata on HIP. Per row b and ratio r in (4, 128): out_loc_r = raw_out_loc // r when seq_lens % r == 0, else 0 (rows below n_write only); positions_r = positions with its low log2(r) bits cleared; seq_lens_raw_r = seq_lens // r; seq_lens_clamp1_r = max(seq_lens_raw_r, 1). c128_page_indices[b, j] = page_table[b, j // c128_page_size] * c128_page_size + j % c128_page_size for j < seq_lens_raw_128, else -1. Integer division truncates toward zero.",
  "op_type": "dsv4_compression_metadata",
